cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived data, please cite both this repository and the paper below."
title: "Reanalysis of public cadmium-stress RNA-seq data in wheat (Triticum aestivum)"
abstract: >-
  Data and code to reproduce the transcriptome analysis of NCBI BioProject PRJNA1124581
  (wild-type wheat roots and shoots, cadmium versus control) reported in Haris et al.:
  DESeq2 differential expression, GO and KEGG enrichment, functional gene groups, and
  STRING protein-protein interaction networks with Maximal Clique Centrality hub ranking.
type: software
license: MIT
